                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "This arch is older than every ledger the Company ever printed, and I keep what sleeps under it asleep. Travellers battle me here. It is the polite way past a ruin."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The old road remembers who walked it. Show it something worth remembering."
                        }
